    q: "What should the first pants inquiry include?",
    a: "The pants family and use case, target fit, size chart or reference measurements, fabric direction with weight, waistband and closure preferences, pocket plan, reinforcement needs, wash direction, branding files, label and packing requirements, destination market, estimated quantity with size split, and target timing. Missing items are recorded as open points in the specification instead of being filled by assumption.",
  },
